    hasMissingSheet = True
    Exit For
End If

VBA immediately exits the config loop

Only the first missing sheet is detected

Other missing config sheets are never checked


This is fine if your rule is:

> “Any single missing required sheet = Invalid”



But it explains why:

Only some issues are detected

Others are skipped



